Modifications by BAE (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
  - All icons are converted at build time into filled outlines and compressed
    into the application binary; they are rasterized and tinted at run time.
  - UI icons (ChevronDownMedium, ChevronLeftMedium, ChevronRightMedium,
    CrossMedium): path data of the medium scale wrapped in an 18x18 SVG with
    the glyph centered.
  - PenAdd, PenDelete, PenConvert, MaskFeather (from VectorDraw), TypeVertical
    (from Text), PuppetStarch, PuppetBend, PuppetAdvanced, PuppetOverlap (from
    PinOn): the Spectrum glyph scaled to 75 % in the top-left corner and a small
    badge drawn by BAE added in the bottom-right corner.

